[00:23.72]Firm and determined in this time of the end,
[00:29.10]Prepared are God’s servants the good news to defend.
[00:34.58]The Devil has fought and opposed them.
[00:40.12]With Jehovah, they take their stand against him.
[00:45.73](Chorus)
[00:45.88]Then forward, you Witnesses, ever strong of heart!
[00:52.08]Rejoice that in God’s work, you too may have a part!
[00:57.48]Go tell far and wide that the Paradise is near
[01:03.06]And that soon all its blessings will be here.
[01:26.94]Servants of Jah do not seek a life of ease;
[01:31.66]The world and its rulers we do not try to please.
[01:37.42]Unspotted at all times remaining,
[01:42.92]Our integrity we will keep maintaining.
[01:48.61](Chorus)
[01:48.76]Then forward, you Witnesses, ever strong of heart!
[01:54.94]Rejoice that in God’s work, you too may have a part!
[02:00.50]Go tell far and wide that the Paradise is near
[02:05.58]And that soon all its blessings will be here.
[02:35.78]God and his Kingdom are mocked and pushed aside;
[02:40.14]His great name is slandered, its holiness denied.
[02:46.24]Let’s share in its sanctification,
[02:51.12]And declare it to ev’ry tribe and nation.
[02:57.17](Chorus)
[02:57.32]Then forward, you Witnesses, ever strong of heart!
[03:03.48]Rejoice that in God’s work, you too may have a part!
[03:09.04]Go tell far and wide that the Paradise is near
[03:14.50]And that soon all its blessings will be here.
